abstract: >-
  Gut-metagenome multi-kingdom analysis platform: bacteria, virome and
  mycobiome chains (183 scripts + Snakemake pipeline), an agent-driven
  metagenome mining loop with ontology curation, and MCP-based
  publication-figure visualization — VibeCoding-ready.
